cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "UrbanMask observation base: Sentinel-2 pixel features and building labels, Goiânia 2020–2023"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-01"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/luizmlpascoal/geoinfo-dataset-urbanmask"
abstract: >-
  4,383,413 Sentinel-2 pixel-years (10 m) from 98,684 vacant-lot polygons in Goiânia, Brazil,
  2020–2023, with 14 spectral, texture and temporal features and a building label derived from
  Google Open Buildings 2.5D Temporal. Training and validation base of the UrbanMask classifiers.
keywords:
  - Sentinel-2
  - building detection
  - Open Buildings Temporal
  - training data
  - urban monitoring
  - Goiânia
